* Identity theorem on the right half-plane: two holomorphic functions there that agree on ` 1 < Re z ` agree everywhere ( ~ holidrect on the rectangle ` [ a , Re z + 2 ] x. [ - abs Im z , abs Im z ] ` , the difference vanishing on the unit disc about ` 2 ` ).

